                        AND NOT EXISTS (
        SELECT
            1
        FROM
            wf_items i
        WHERE
            i.item_type = ''OEOL''
            AND i.parent_item_key = to_char(h.header_id)
                AND i.parent_item_type = ''OEOH''
                    AND i.end_date IS NULL
    )',
      p_title                  => 'Order Header Open With No Open Line, No Header Workflow and No Line Workflow',
      p_fail_condition         => 'RS',
      p_problem_descr          => 'Sales Order Header is stuck in an open status with no associated open lines, order header workflow or order line workflows.',
      p_solution               => 'Refer to solution in [397565/KB746001].

Patch 31806934:R12.ONT.B provides a datafix script, ontd0074.sql, that will close open sales order headers that
exist with no associated open lines, order header workflow or order line workflows.  For all such order headers,
the script contained in this patch sets Open Flag to N and Flow Status Code to Closed or Cancelled.',
